  "title": "Brown & Brown, Inc. announces quarterly cash dividend",
  "summary": "DAYTONA BEACH, Fla., July 22, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Brown & Brown, Inc. (NYSE: BRO) announces that the board of directors has declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.165 per share. The dividend is payable on August 19, 2026, to shareholders of record on August 12, 2026.",
